    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "ECI does NOT conduct local body elections (Panchayats and Municipalities); these are conducted by State Election Commissions.",
        "The Constitution does not specify the educational, legal, or administrative qualifications of ECI members.",
        "Other Election Commissioners cannot be removed from office except on the recommendation of the Chief Election Commissioner."
